<title>YEMEN: Emirates starts weekly flight to Yemen.</title>
<headline>Emirates starts weekly flight to Yemen.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dubai government-owned Emirates airline has started a once-weekly flight to Sanaa, officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Emirates chairman, Sheikh Ahmed bin Said al-Maktoum and other officials flew in on the first flight on Monday.</p>
<p>Emirates flies to over 40 destinations.</p>
</text>
